              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa huwo mtalo ghwa wandu wa Israeli kunughana na vichuku vawo, awo werekoghe wa miaka mirongo iwi na kuchumba; awo wose widimagha kughenda wudenyi, ",
          "type": "text",
